{"unit_id":"tag:03AN:proof","translation":"这成立，因为层条件（sheaf condition）恰好要求 <MATH_0001> 对 <MATH_0002> 的每个覆盖（covering）都是双射（bijective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"bijective","target_term":"双射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件","context":"阿贝尔预层的判据，待批准"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"层条件，待批准"},{"source_term":"bijective","target_term":"双射","context":"自然映射，待批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03AK:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为范畴（category）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 <MATH_0003> 中靶固定的态射族（family of morphisms），使得所有纤维积（fibre products）<MATH_0004> 都在 <MATH_0005> 中存在。设 <MATH_0006> 为另一个这样的族。设 <MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008> 和 <MATH_0009> 为靶固定的态射族（families of morphisms）的态射（morphism），见《位点（Sites）》第 <REF_0001> 节。这时得到 <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech 复形（complexes）的映射（map）\n<MATH_0010>，其在次数（degree）<MATH_0011> 处由 <MATH_0012> 给出。\n\n\n","allowed_english":["ech"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"底层范畴，待批准"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"固定靶的族，待批准"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"Čech 复形条件，待批准"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"态射的对象，待批准"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"态射族之间，待批准"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"章节引用，待批准"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"Čech 复形，待批准"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"复形映射，待批准"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数","context":"复形的次数，待批准"}],"notes":[]}
